      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "[ALT] Se uidDriver existe\n\n13. UI → DriverService: getDriverAvailable(uidDriver)\n14. DriverService → Firestore: Busca motorista\n15. Firestore → DriverService: driverUser\n16. DriverService → UI: itemDriver.data()\n\n17. UI: Cria objeto dataDriver {driver_name, driver_user, status: 'hired'}\n\n18. UI → FreightService: saveDriverQueueFreight(item.id, uid, dataDriver)\n19. FreightService → Firestore: Salva na fila do frete\n20. Firestore → FreightService: OK\n\n21. UI → DriverService: saveMyFreight(uid, item.id, dataDriver)\n22. DriverService → Firestore: Salva em myFreightsList\n23. Firestore → DriverService: OK\n\n24. UI → FreightService: updateStatusFreight(item.id, 'Contratado', '04')\n25. FreightService → Firestore: Atualiza status\n26. Firestore → FreightService: OK\n\n27. UI: Prepara notificação (title + msg)\n28. UI → NotificationService: sendNotification(idNotification, msg)\n29. NotificationService → UI: Enviado\n\n30. UI → DriverService: saveMessageInMyFreight(uidDriver, title, msg)\n31. DriverService → Firestore: Salva mensagem\n32. Firestore → DriverService: OK",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[ALT] Se uidDriver existe\n\n13. UI → DriverService: getDriverAvailable(uidDriver)\n14. DriverService → Firestore: Busca motorista\n15. Firestore → DriverService: driverUser\n16. DriverService → UI: itemDriver.data()\n\n17. UI: Cria objeto dataDriver {driver_name, driver_user, status: 'hired'}\n\n18. UI → FreightService: saveDriverQueueFreight(item.id, uid, dataDriver)\n19. FreightService → Firestore: Salva na fila do frete\n20. Firestore → FreightService: OK\n\n21. UI → DriverService: saveMyFreight(uid, item.id, dataDriver)\n22. DriverService → Firestore: Salva em myFreightsList\n23. Firestore → DriverService: OK\n\n24. UI → FreightService: updateStatusFreight(item.id, 'Contratado', '04')\n25. FreightService → Firestore: Atualiza status\n26. Firestore → FreightService: OK\n\n27. UI: Prepara notificação (title + msg)\n28. UI → NotificationService: sendNotification(idNotification, msg)\n29. NotificationService → UI: Enviado\n\n30. UI → DriverService: saveMessageInMyFreight(uidDriver, title, msg)\n31. DriverService → Firestore: Salva mensagem\n32. Firestore → DriverService: OK",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 424
    },
